  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation and Startup Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s goal is to increase job creation, to improve the business environment, and to strengthen the competitiveness of start-ups in the ICT sector. The planned effects for the target group of the project are increased success rate and growth, in a business environment that is improved. 
The intended target group is start-ups in the ICT sector.</narrative>
  </description>
